==Battleground==
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Blanka is only buffed to 1% here so it is not a threat at all. The most optimal strategy is to rush the base with (preferably) a Cow/Giraffe Cat to get all the rewards. Even just a level 1 [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] works.

